      "content": "# Attendee instructions\n\nThis instructor-led and self-paced lab builds the Caldova Supplier Assurance Agent in Microsoft Copilot Studio.\n\n## Start the lab\n\nReview the [lab overview](../lab/README.md), then complete each section in order:\n\n1. [Introduction and sign in](../lab/instructions/00-Introduction.md)\n2. [Build the Supplier Assurance Agent](../lab/instructions/01-Build-The-Agent.md)\n3. [Add SharePoint knowledge](../lab/instructions/02-Add-SharePoint-Knowledge.md)\n4. [Connect the SharePoint MCP](../lab/instructions/03-Connect-SharePoint-MCP.md)\n5. [Add skills and review an invoice](../lab/instructions/04-Add-Skills-And-Review-Invoice.md)\n6. [Evaluate and publish the agent](../lab/instructions/05-Evaluate-And-Publish.md)\n7. [Build the workflow](../lab/instructions/06-Complete-The-Workflow.md)\n8. [Run the solution end to end](../lab/instructions/07-Test-End-To-End.md)\n\nFor self-paced use, provision the prerequisites in the [environment guide](../environment/README.md) first. Skillable variables shown in the instructions must be replaced with values from your own environment.\n"
